  'P0442': ['EVAP system leak detected (small leak .04-inch)', 'Evaporative Emission Control system leak detected (Small Leak)\nPossible causes: Loose fuel filler cap; Small vapor leaks at the plastic vacuum line connection to the Vapor Management Valve (VMV); Small vapor leaks at the fuel vapor hose connections to the VMV, the Fuel Tank Pressure (FTP) sensor and the fuel vapor storage canister; Small cuts or holes in evaporative emission system; EVAP Canister leaking; CV Solenoid partially open when commanded closed; Aftermarket parts and accessories nonconforming to the EVAP system specifications. Note: DTC P0442/P1442 indicates that a leak has been detected [As small as 0.040 inch (.10cm)] in the Evaporative Emission System. Please reference 1998 or later PCED diagnostics for this code', 'Suspect evaporative system vacuum or vapor hose leak', 'EVAP System Leak Detected (small leak)'],
  'P0443': ['EVAP System Purge Control Valve Circuit', 'Evaporative Emission Control System Purge Valve Malfunction', 'Purge valve circuit fault', 'EVAP canister purge valve circuit fault', 'Evaporative Emission Vapour Management Fault', 'Canister purge circuit malfunction', 'Evaporative Emission System Purge Control Valve "A" Circuit', 'EVAP System Purge Control Valve \'A\' Circuit'],
  'P0444': ['EVAP control system purge control valve circuit open', 'EVAP System Purge Control Valve \'A\' Circuit Open'],
  'P0445': ['EVAP control system purge control valve circuit shorted', 'EVAP System Purge Control Valve \'A\' Circuit Shorted'],
  'P0446': ['EVAP System Vent Control Circuit', 'Evaporative Emission Control system vent control malfunction\nPossible causes: Open between Fuel Tank Pressure (FTP) sensor and VREF; Damaged FTP sensor; Restricted carbon canister vent; Damaged Canister Vent (CV) solenoid filter; Kink or blockage in vapor hose/tube between CV solenoid and atmosphere; Short to PWR GND in CV signal circuit; Damaged CV solenoid; Damaged PCM Note: DTC P0446 indicates excessive fuel tank pressure', 'EVAP control system vent control valve circuit malfunction'],
  'P0447': ['EVAP System Vent Control Circuit Open', 'EVAP control system purge control valve circuit open'],
