  'P06E9': ['Engine Starter Performance', 'DTC P06E9:XX-YY is listed as P06E9[79] on workshop materials. Failure part and type P06E9 = Starter non-engagement Current/historical DTC If status byte [YY] is [01] or [09], it is a current DTC. If the status byte is [08], it is a historical DTC. ------- Ignore the information below. It is not necessary for diagnosing this DTC'],
