  'P0805': ['Clutch Position Sensor Circuit', 'Clutch position sensor', 'Clutch position sensor circuit malfunction', 'DTC P0805:XX-YY is listed as P0805[XX] on workshop materials. Failure part/circuit P0805 = Clutch stroke sensor failure Failure type (XX above) 11 = Clutch stroke sensor failure 1 (MT) 12 = Clutch stroke sensor failure 2 (MT) Current/historical DTC If status byte [YY] is [01] or [09], it is a current DTC. If the status byte is [08], it is a historical DTC. ------- Ignore the information below. It is not necessary for diagnosing this DTC', 'Clutch Position Sensor \'A\' Circuit'],
