  'P1900': ['Output Shaft Speed Sensor Intermittent', 'DTC P1900:XX-YY is listed as P1900[21] on workshop materials. Failure part and type P1900 = Battery Voltage Reduction Current/historical DTC If status byte [YY] is [01] or [09], it is a current DTC. If the status byte is [08], it is a historical DTC. ------- Ignore the information below. It is not necessary for diagnosing this DTC', 'Output Shaft Speed Sensor Circuit Intermittent'],
